  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Hosa Aba. Objective: Avoid having the lowest hand value (sum of cards in one suit) at the end of the round.',
    Player: 'Hosa Aba: play by the rules, manage scoring opportunities, and pursue the win condition.',
    objective: "Avoid having the lowest hand value (sum of cards in one suit) at the end of the round. Players start with 3 'lives'.",
    gameplay: "1. The dealer can swap their hand for 'The Window' before revealing it to the group.\n2. In turn, players can: - **Swap ONE**: Exchange one hand card with one center card. - **Swap ALL**: Exchange the entire hand. - **Pass**: Do nothing for the turn. - **Close (Knock)**: Signal the final round. All other players get ONE more turn.\n3. **Hosa Aba (31)**: If a player reaches 31, they reveal immediately and the round ends instantly.",
    keyRules: [
      'Follow the legal action constraints defined for Hosa Aba.',
      'Round outcome is resolved by the scoring method: - Only cards of the SAME SUIT are summed.',
      'Winning condition: Avoid having the lowest hand value (sum of cards in one suit) at the end of the round.',
    ],
