    turnFlow: "1. The dealer can swap their hand for 'The Window' before revealing it to the group.\n2. In turn, players can: - **Swap ONE**: Exchange one hand card with one center card. - **Swap ALL**: Exchange the entire hand. - **Pass**: Do nothing for the turn. - **Close (Knock)**: Signal the final round. All other players get ONE more turn.\n3. **Hosa Aba (31)**: If a player reaches 31, they reveal immediately and the round ends instantly.",
